<title>USA: Total World merger talks terminated.</title>
<headline>Total World merger talks terminated.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total World Telecommunications Inc said the previously announced discussions with World Wide Leisure Corp have been terminated by the company.</p>
<p>&quot;We have not received the data we had previously requested from World Wide Leisure Corp that would allow us to form an opinion on their proposal,&quot; Total World said in a statement.</p>
</text>
